# Float addition of exactly representable values

Adds 1.5 and 2.25 to verify native single-precision addition for values
exactly representable in f32, producing 3.75.

>>> source
float_left: float = 1.5
float_right: float = 2.25

float_sum: float = float_left + float_right
print(float_sum)

<<< stdout
3.75

<<< stderr
